  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Str or Int, +1 Any, except Str or Int.\nSpeed: 30 feet.\nSkill Proficiencies: Perception, Survival.\nExtra Language: Bio-Speak, you understand Mutants and other artificially created beings that either have no language, or have developed their own makeshift language, being able to communicate with these creatures telepathically, while within 10 feet of them.\nPassive Affinity: You begin with either Fire, Water or Lightning Release Affinity (Pick one).\nSynthetic Techniques: The Jinzo Clan has access to a separate list of Jutsu unique to their Clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the Normal jutsu list(s).\nHijutsu Flexibility: Jinzo Clan Hijutsu can use either Intelligence or Wisdom as its casting ability score.\nBranch Family: The Jinzo are split between two different branches, the [Shin Branch] and the [Bio Branch], also known amongst village elites as the Synthetic Human: Jiraiya or Orochimaru strains. The [Shin Branch] are members who were not born, but instead made. People who were given consciousness at their current stage in life, with no inherent memories beyond those they suddenly woke up with. The [Bio Branch] are members who were artificially born from a single strand of genetic data, with the inherent goal of evolving and surpassing the source of their DNA. This determines some clan features or which Hijutsu you gain/have access to. This cannot be changed later.",
